import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---
<ContentLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure | StackGeist" description="How affiliate links work on StackGeist and how product recommendations are handled.">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <p class="page-kicker">Disclosure</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">StackGeist uses affiliate links on some product recommendations. The commercial relationship is disclosed so you can evaluate the recommendation with that context.</p>
    <p class="effective">Effective August 16, 2026</p>
    <div class="disclosure-callout"><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong><p>When you buy through a qualifying Amazon link, StackGeist may receive a commission. Your purchase price is set by the retailer.</p></div>
    <div class="legal-body">
      <section><h2>How affiliate links are identified</h2><p>Amazon affiliate links are accompanied by a nearby disclosure such as “Paid link” or a statement that StackGeist may earn a commission. A general disclosure page is not used as a substitute for link-level disclosure.</p></section>
      <section><h2>How recommendations are made</h2><p>Affiliate eligibility does not make a product a recommendation. StackGeist is designed around use cases, constraints, verified specifications, and explicit tradeoffs. A product link is added only when the product is intended to solve the problem described on the page.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Testing and product claims</h2><p>StackGeist does not claim that a product was personally tested unless that testing actually occurred. Specifications and compatibility claims are based on information from manufacturers, retailers, or other identified sources available when the recommendation is prepared.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Prices and availability</h2><p>Retail prices, promotions, inventory, seller availability, and product details can change. StackGeist does not treat a displayed or previously observed price as guaranteed. Check the retailer before purchasing.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Non-affiliate links</h2><p>Some links go directly to manufacturers or other resources and may not generate compensation. When a retailer link is an affiliate link, the relationship is disclosed near the link.</p></section>
    </div>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
